_struct_biol.details               
;THERE ARE FOUR CORE DOMAINS AND ONE DNA BINDING DOMAIN IN
  THE ASYMMETRIC UNIT.  THE FOUR CORE DOMAINS ARE LABELLED A
  A, B, C AND D.  THE DNA BINDING DOMAIN ARE LABELLED AS X.
  THE MISSING RESIDUES ARE:
  CORE DOMAIN A, A50-A54, A141-A151
  CORE DOMAIN B; B50-B54, B141-B151, B208-B212.
  CORE DOMAIN C; C50-C54, C141-C150, C208-C212.
  CORE DOMAIN D; D50-D54, D141-D151, C208-C212.
  DNA BINDING DOMAIN; X214-X215 ,X230-232, X271-X292.
;
